  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture Sector Wide Approach - Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal: To improve the effectiveness of investments aimed at food security and sustainable agricultural growth, and strengthen the natural resource base in agricultural lands, through a doubling of the area under sustainable land management as a basis for securing ecosystem services and sustainable agricultural productivity.</narrative>
  </description>
